# The PDA profile's writing zone (report 041, phase S3; report 042: on demand, no soft buttons) on the profile pda
# (480x800 = the Pi 3A+ 4.3" DSI turned, 480x640 = a 3.5" panel turned): the home grid has no text field, so the band
# (the key strip and the writing boxes) is hidden and the home grid gets the whole panel; the input rule is the usual
# one (vkb=auto). Goldens at both sizes.
title zone home
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=fixture:ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=fixture:store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_zone hidden
expect_vkb auto
shot zone_home
